{% doc %}
  @prompt
    You are a senior Shopify theme developer. Build ONE production-ready Online Store 2.0 section (a single .liquid file) that recreates the attached reference banner exactly: same layout, proportions, typography hierarchy, colors, curved card and pill button. Return ONLY the complete code (Liquid + CSS + {% schema %}). No explanations, no commentary, no placeholder lorem ipsum.
    
    The baby photo, blanket, plant and soft light are all part of ONE background image that I will upload. Do NOT draw, recreate or substitute them. The three round trust icons (bamboo, cotton, leaf) are images that I will upload into blocks., 1. HARD RULES (do not break any)
    =====================================================
    1. FONT: Montserrat ONLY. Load it with <link rel="preconnect"> plus a Google Fonts stylesheet (Montserrat weights 300;400;500;600;700;800, display=swap). Set font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif on the section root and force every child to inherit it. Do NOT add font_picker settings. Do NOT use theme fonts or any second font.
    2. NOTHING hardcoded: every piece of text, every color, size, weight, spacing, radius, link and toggle must be a section or block setting. Default copy and values live only in the schema "default" keys.
    3. ALL text fields are type "richtext" (CTA label is the only plain "text"). Follow the rich-text rendering rules in section 7.
    4. Every setting has a default, a clear label and, where useful, "info" stating the unit. Group settings with "header" type settings exactly as listed in section 5. The schema must be valid JSON with unique ids.
    5. Scope all CSS to the section (#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} or a wrapper class with the section id). Use the class prefix "mbh-". Push settings into CSS custom properties on the wrapper (for example --mbh-heading-size) and use var() everywhere.
    6. No JavaScript libraries, no external CSS, no theme-specific classes or snippets. Pure Liquid + CSS (JS only if absolutely unavoidable).
    7. Fully responsive, mobile-first. Breakpoints: mobile below 750px, desktop 990px and up. Between 750px and 1440px scale type fluidly with clamp(mobileValue, vw-based value, desktopValue)., 8. Images: use image_url with srcset (widths 750, 1100, 1500, 1800, 2200, 2800), sizes="100vw", width/height attributes, object-fit: cover, alt = image.alt with a sensible fallback. Honor the image focal point via object-position. Checkbox "Load background image eagerly (use for first section on page)": when on, loading="eager" and fetchpriority="high", otherwise loading="lazy".
    9. Empty states: if an element's text or image is empty, do not render that element or leave an empty gap. If no background image is set, show the fallback background color.
    10. Do not add any element that is not in the reference (no extra badges, icons, sliders, popups).
    11. Accessibility: semantic heading tag (selectable), visible :focus-visible outline on the CTA, decorative line and arrow SVG marked aria-hidden, respect prefers-reduced-motion for hover transitions., 2. LAYOUT (desktop, 990px and up)
    =====================================================
    The section is full-bleed (100% width, no side margins), aspect ratio approx 16:9, height controlled by a setting (default 760px). The background image is absolutely positioned and covers the section. An optional color overlay sits above it (default 0% opacity). All content sits above the overlay. The center ~38% of the width must stay EMPTY so the baby in the photo remains visible.
    
    Three content zones:
    
    ZONE A, top-left text block (max-width 560px, left padding 88px, top offset 80px):
      a) Eyebrow row: small uppercase, very wide letter-spacing, followed on the same row by a thin horizontal line (80px wide, 1px) vertically centered with the text, 28px gap between text and line.
      b) Heading (2 lines, large): line 1 "Softer Days" in BOLD (700) dark olive green; line 2 "for a Brighter Tomorrow" in REGULAR (400) charcoal. They wrap naturally to about 3 visual lines at 560px width ("Softer Days / for a Brighter / Tomorrow"). Tight line-height (1.15), slight negative letter-spacing (-0.01em). The bold/regular split comes from <strong> inside the richtext (see rule 7).
      c) Supporting paragraph under the heading, 24px gap above, max-width 470px, regular weight, charcoal, line-height 1.5.
    
    ZONE B, bottom-left trust badges row (aligned to the same left padding as Zone A, 40px from the bottom):
      - Horizontal row of up to 4 items (default 3), 28px gap.
      - Each item is a vertical stack: a circular image (100px diameter, object-fit cover, 4px solid white ring, optional soft shadow) and, centered under it, a small uppercase label with wide letter-spacing, max 2 lines, item width 130px.
      - A thin vertical divider line (1px, about 50px tall, vertically centered on the circles) sits between items. Toggle on/off. Not after the last item.
    
    ZONE C, bottom-right card:
      - Anchored flush to the RIGHT and BOTTOM edges of the section (no gap). Width 31% of the section (min 340px).
      - Background: warm cream (#F4ECE1) at 96% opacity.
      - ONLY the top-left corner is rounded, with a very large elliptical swoop (default radius 320px, e.g. border-top-left-radius: 320px 260px). The other three corners are square.
      - Padding: 48px (more on the left and top to follow the curve visually).
      - Content, left-aligned, top to bottom:
          1. Card heading, 2 lines: "Gentle on Baby." (regular weight, charcoal) then "Kinder to the Planet." (semibold 600, olive green). ~30px, line-height 1.2.
          2. Card paragraph, ~14px, line-height 1.55, charcoal-grey, 16px below the heading, max 3 lines.
          3. CTA button, 28px below the paragraph.
      - CTA: pill shape (fully rounded), solid olive green background, white uppercase text, medium weight (500), wide letter-spacing (0.12em), ~14px, padding 18px 36px, followed by a right-pointing arrow (inline SVG, stroke currentColor, 18px) 14px after the label. Arrow nudges 4px right on hover. Hover state: darker green background., 3. MOBILE LAYOUT (below 750px)
    =====================================================
    - Section height becomes auto. The background image still covers the whole section (separate optional mobile image picker; falls back to the desktop image).
    - Vertical stack, in this order: Zone A text (padding 32px 20px 0, alignment from a "mobile text alignment" setting: left or center), then an empty spacer so the baby stays visible (height setting, default 300px), then the Zone B trust badges (3 in one row, icons 64px, labels 10px, row centered, dividers kept), then Zone C card.
    - The card becomes full width and flush with the bottom, left and right edges. Its top-left curve is scaled down to min(setting, 120px). Padding 28px 20px 32px.
    - The CTA becomes full width inside the card (setting: "Full width CTA on mobile", default on).
    
    =====================================================
    4. DEFAULT VALUES (extracted from the reference)
    =====================================================
    Colors:
      Olive green accent (heading bold part, card accent line): #4A5738
      Button background: #56653F   Button hover: #3F4D2C   Button text: #FFFFFF
      Heading regular color: #2B2B2B   Body text: #3A3A3A   Eyebrow: #3A3A3A
      Card background: #F4ECE1   Fallback section background: #F3E9DD
      Trust icon ring: #FFFFFF   Divider/eyebrow line: #8F8A80
    
    Sizes (desktop / mobile):
      Eyebrow 12px / 10px, weight 500, letter-spacing 0.30em, uppercase
      Heading 64px / 36px, regular weight 400, bold weight 700, line-height 1.15
      Subtext 18px / 15px, weight 400
      Trust label 12px / 10px, weight 500, letter-spacing 0.15em, uppercase
      Card heading 30px / 22px, weight 400, accent weight 600
      Card text 14px / 13px, weight 400
      CTA text 14px / 13px, weight 500, letter-spacing 0.12em, uppercase
{% enddoc %}
{% assign mbh = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign background = block.settings.mobile_image | default: block.settings.background_image %}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
{% style %}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}{--mbh-height:{{ block.settings.height }}px;--mbh-mobile-space:{{ block.settings.mobile_spacer }}px;--mbh-fallback:{{ block.settings.fallback }};--mbh-overlay:{{ block.settings.overlay | color_modify:'alpha',block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by:100.0 }};--mbh-olive:{{ block.settings.olive }};--mbh-charcoal:{{ block.settings.charcoal }};--mbh-body:{{ block.settings.body_color }};--mbh-cream:{{ block.settings.cream | color_modify:'alpha',block.settings.cream_opacity | divided_by:100.0 }};--mbh-button:{{ block.settings.button_bg }};--mbh-button-hover:{{ block.settings.button_hover }};--mbh-button-text:{{ block.settings.button_text }};--mbh-left:{{ block.settings.left_padding }}px;--mbh-top:{{ block.settings.top_offset }}px;--mbh-bottom:{{ block.settings.bottom_offset }}px;--mbh-heading:{{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;--mbh-copy:{{ block.settings.copy_size }}px;--mbh-icon:{{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;--mbh-label:{{ block.settings.label_size }}px;--mbh-card-width:{{ block.settings.card_width }}%;--mbh-swoop:{{ block.settings.swoop }}px;--mbh-card-pad:{{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;--mbh-card-heading:{{ block.settings.card_heading_size }}px;--mbh-card-copy:{{ block.settings.card_copy_size }}px;--mbh-cta-size:{{ block.settings.cta_size }}px;--mbh-cta-radius:{{ block.settings.cta_radius }}px;--mbh-mobile-align:{{ block.settings.mobile_alignment }};display:block;position:relative;isolation:isolate;overflow:hidden;width:100%;min-height:var(--mbh-height);background:var(--mbh-fallback);color:var(--mbh-charcoal);font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }},#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }} *{box-sizing:border-box;font-family:inherit}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__background,#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__background{z-index:-2;object-fit:cover;object-position:{{ background.presentation.focal_point | default:'50% 50%' }}}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__overlay{z-index:-1;background:var(--mbh-overlay);pointer-events:none}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__text{position:relative;z-index:1;width:min(560px,62%);padding:var(--mbh-top) 0 0 var(--mbh-left)}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;margin:0 0 24px;color:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};font-size:{{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__line{display:block;width:80px;height:1px;flex:none;background:{{ block.settings.line_color }}}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__heading{margin:0;color:var(--mbh-charcoal);font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,var(--mbh-heading));font-weight:400;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.01em}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__heading p{margin:0}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__heading strong{color:var(--mbh-olive);font-weight:700}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__copy{max-width:470px;margin-top:24px;color:var(--mbh-body);font-size:var(--mbh-copy);line-height:1.5}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__copy p{margin:0}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__spacer{display:none}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__badges{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:var(--mbh-left);bottom:var(--mbh-bottom);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;max-width:65%}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__badge{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:130px;text-align:center}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__icon{display:block;width:var(--mbh-icon);height:var(--mbh-icon);border:4px solid #fff;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;{% if block.settings.shadow %}box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.15);{% endif %}}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__label{color:{{ block.settings.label_color }};font-size:var(--mbh-label);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.15em;line-height:1.4;text-transform:uppercase}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__label p{margin:0}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__divider{display:block;width:1px;height:50px;flex:none;background:{{ block.settings.divider_color }}}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card{position:absolute;z-index:2;right:0;bottom:0;width:max(var(--mbh-card-width),340px);max-width:60%;padding:56px var(--mbh-card-pad) 48px 76px;border-radius:var(--mbh-swoop) 0 0 0 / 260px 0 0 0;background:var(--mbh-cream);color:var(--mbh-charcoal)}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-heading{margin:0;font-size:var(--mbh-card-heading);font-weight:400;line-height:1.2}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-heading p{margin:0}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-heading strong{color:var(--mbh-olive);font-weight:600}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-copy{max-width:42ch;margin-top:16px;color:var(--mbh-body);font-size:var(--mbh-card-copy);line-height:1.55}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-copy p{margin:0}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;margin-top:28px;padding:18px 36px;border:0;border-radius:var(--mbh-cta-radius);background:var(--mbh-button);color:var(--mbh-button-text);font-size:var(--mbh-cta-size);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.12em;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;transition:background-color .2s ease}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__cta:hover{background:var(--mbh-button-hover)}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__cta:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--mbh-button-text);outline-offset:4px}
#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__arrow{width:18px;height:18px;flex:none;transition:transform .2s ease}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__cta:hover .mbh-{{ mbh }}__arrow{transform:translateX(4px)}
@media(min-width:750px) and (max-width:1440px){#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__heading{font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,var(--mbh-heading))}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__text{padding-left:clamp(32px,6.1vw,var(--mbh-left))}}
@media(max-width:749px){#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}{min-height:0;height:auto;overflow:hidden;padding-bottom:0}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__background{position:absolute;inset:0;height:100%;object-position:{{ background.presentation.focal_point | default:'50% 50%' }}}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__text{width:100%;padding:32px 20px 0;text-align:var(--mbh-mobile-align)}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__eyebrow{justify-content:var(--mbh-mobile-align);margin-bottom:18px;font-size:10px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__line{width:48px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__heading{font-size:36px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__copy{margin:16px auto 0;font-size:15px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__spacer{display:block;height:var(--mbh-mobile-space)}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__badges{position:relative;inset:auto;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:12px;max-width:100%;padding:0 12px 28px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__badge{width:calc((100% - 48px)/3);max-width:100px;gap:8px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__icon{width:64px;height:64px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__divider{height:40px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card{position:relative;right:auto;bottom:auto;width:100%;max-width:none;min-width:0;padding:28px 20px 32px;border-radius:min(var(--mbh-swoop),120px) 0 0 0 / min(100px,120px) 0 0 0}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-heading{font-size:22px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-copy{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px}#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__cta{margin-top:20px;padding:16px 22px;font-size:13px;{% if block.settings.mobile_full_cta %}width:100%;{% endif %}}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__cta,#shopify-block-{{ block.id }} .mbh-{{ mbh }}__arrow{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>{% if background != blank %}{% assign alt_text=background.alt | default:block.settings.image_alt %}{% assign load='lazy' %}{% if block.settings.eager %}{% assign load='eager' %}{% endif %}<img class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__background" src="{{ background | image_url:width:1800 }}" srcset="{{ background | image_url:width:750 }} 750w, {{ background | image_url:width:1100 }} 1100w, {{ background | image_url:width:1500 }} 1500w, {{ background | image_url:width:1800 }} 1800w, {{ background | image_url:width:2200 }} 2200w, {{ background | image_url:width:2800 }} 2800w" sizes="100vw" alt="{{ alt_text | escape }}" width="{{ background.width }}" height="{{ background.height }}" loading="{{ load }}"{% if block.settings.eager %} fetchpriority="high"{% endif %}>{% endif %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__text">{% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | strip_html }}<span class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__line" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.heading != blank %}{% assign tag=block.settings.heading_tag %}<{{ tag }} class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</{{ tag }}>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.description != blank %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__copy">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>{% endif %}</div><div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
{% assign any_badge=false %}{% for i in (1..4) %}{% assign ik='trust_image_' | append:i %}{% assign lk='trust_label_' | append:i %}{% if block.settings[ik]!=blank or block.settings[lk]!=blank %}{% assign any_badge=true %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if any_badge %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__badges">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% assign ik='trust_image_' | append:i %}{% assign lk='trust_label_' | append:i %}{% assign img=block.settings[ik] %}{% assign label=block.settings[lk] %}{% if img!=blank or label!=blank %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__badge">{% if img!=blank %}<img class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__icon" src="{{ img | image_url:width:240 }}" srcset="{{ img | image_url:width:120 }} 120w, {{ img | image_url:width:240 }} 240w, {{ img | image_url:width:480 }} 480w" sizes="64px" alt="{{ img.alt | default:label | strip_html | escape }}" width="{{ img.width }}" height="{{ img.height }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}{% if label!=blank %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__label">{{ label }}</div>{% endif %}</div>{% assign ni=i | plus:1 %}{% assign nik='trust_image_' | append:ni %}{% assign nlk='trust_label_' | append:ni %}{% if block.settings.dividers and ni<=4 %}{% if block.settings[nik]!=blank or block.settings[nlk]!=blank %}<span class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
{% if block.settings.card_heading!=blank or block.settings.card_copy!=blank or block.settings.cta_label!=blank and block.settings.cta_link!=blank %}<aside class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__card">{% if block.settings.card_heading!=blank %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-heading">{{ block.settings.card_heading }}</div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.card_copy!=blank %}<div class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__card-copy">{{ block.settings.card_copy }}</div>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.cta_label!=blank and block.settings.cta_link!=blank %}<a class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__cta" href="{{ block.settings.cta_link }}">{{ block.settings.cta_label | escape }}<svg class="mbh-{{ mbh }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>{% endif %}</aside>{% endif %}</div>
{% schema %}
